    "description": "SVRTAE\n\nThe National Weather Service in Tallahassee has issued a\n\n* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...\nSouthwestern Liberty County in Big Bend Florida...\nNorthwestern Franklin County in Big Bend Florida...\n\n* Until 730 PM EDT.\n\n* At 639 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 18 miles northwest\nof Carrabelle, moving southwest at 20 mph.\n\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nBuck Siding, Morgan Place, Sumatra, Twin Pole, Beverly, Owens\nBridge, and Fort Gadsden.",
